---
title: "Liked Music"
description: "Every track I've liked on Spotify, synced live from a running Google Sheet and shelved like a crate of records."
date: 2026-08-06
---

<p><a href="{{ '/music/' | url }}">← Music</a></p>

<p>Whenever I hit like on a track — on my phone, in CarPlay, wherever — an IFTTT recipe drops a row into <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1mGFy2np-VSWWMDaVSywqJLxZF9htT9kcj-SboyHJuZs/edit">this Google Sheet</a>. This page reads that sheet straight from your browser every time it loads:</p>

<ul>
  <li>Always current — a new like shows up here without anything needing to rebuild.</li>
  <li>Keeps this out of the 11ty build entirely, rather than adding sheet-fetching and data-wrangling to the build pipeline just for one page.</li>
</ul>

<p>Follow me on Spotify as <a href="https://open.spotify.com/user/sijobling?si=LinYVO5vTt6lM6sdZlML9A&amp;utm_source=copy-link">One Phat DJ</a> — expect a lot of house, since a good chunk of what lands here also ends up in a House Finesse set.</p>

<div id="record-collection" class="record-collection" data-sheet-id="1mGFy2np-VSWWMDaVSywqJLxZF9htT9kcj-SboyHJuZs">
  <p class="record-collection__status" role="status">Loading the crate…</p>

  <ul class="record-shelf" tabindex="0" aria-label="Liked tracks, scrollable"></ul>

  <div class="record-collection__controls">
    <button type="button" class="record-nav record-nav--prev" aria-label="Scroll to previous records">‹</button>
    <button type="button" class="record-nav record-nav--next" aria-label="Scroll to next records">›</button>
  </div>

  <div class="record-collection__player" hidden>
    <p class="record-collection__now-playing" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <iframe class="record-collection__player-frame" title="Spotify player" width="100%" height="152" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy"></iframe>
  </div>
</div>

<template id="record-sleeve-template">
  <li class="record-sleeve">
    <a class="record-sleeve__link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <span class="record-sleeve__frame">
        <span class="record-sleeve__vinyl" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="record-sleeve__art record-sleeve__art--loading">
          <img class="record-sleeve__art-image" alt="" loading="lazy">
        </span>
      </span>
      <span class="record-sleeve__meta">
        <span class="record-sleeve__title"></span>
        <span class="record-sleeve__artist"></span>
        <span class="record-sleeve__date"></span>
      </span>
    </a>
  </li>
  <i hidden class="record-sleeve__art--fallback"></i>
</template>

<p><small>Cover art is fetched from Spotify per track and cached in your browser.</small></p>

<script defer src="{{ '/js/music-liked.js' | addHash }}"></script>
